ive build after verified archival preservation.\n\nValidation: `scripts/check` passed under pinned Node 22.23.2/npm 10.9.8, including embedded-asset verification, formatting, Clippy, 53 Rust tests and one web test (one existing benchmark ignored). Source mirrors and consolidated Git objects pass `git fsck --full`; all six snapshot tree IDs match. Specification SHA-256 is `1d8064b40041e9383b66b790eb8eaa41924657db5f5d1bb0a5373fc5c501b9eb`. Diff whitespace check excludes only the unmodified specification's original Markdown hard breaks.\n\nBF3 scope: carries all BF3-001–030 / AT / HF / CF requirements forward without claiming new runtime completion. Operating HOLD remains effective. No live provider execution, launcher cutover, repository deletion or restored controller code occurs in this PR. PR B starts only after this PR merges with successful hosted `check` and different-vendor exact-head process review. Shared-account comments are not native GitHub approvals.\n\nbf-author: codex/codex-consolidation\nbf-claim: c-49\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neverhuman/bulletfarm/issues/1/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neverhuman/bulletfarm/issues/1/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"}]]
